/**
 * The six views of the subject in a 3 × 2 grid: the front (the source image,
 * read-only) and back / left / right / top / bottom, each uploaded by hand
 * (file picker or drag & drop) or generated by AI from the front. Full 3D
 * drivers use every view given. Pure: the shell owns the images and jobs.
 *
 * Hand-made views rarely share the front's framing, so each filled slot
 * shows a consistency badge (the shell's pre-run registration against the
 * front), an "Align" panel with an overlay, offset / scale / flip sliders
 * and a trust choice (shape + colour / colour only / off), and every other
 * slot a "Copy prompt" button giving an English prompt with the front's
 * exact framing for the user's own image tool.
 */
